WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.856 --> 00:00:06.552
Let me explain the difference between a specialist shop and a wedding hall package.

2
00:00:06.888 --> 00:00:14.016
A wedding hall package bundles wedding-parent makeup together with use of the hall's facilities and dining.

3
00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:21.480
To attract bookings, wedding halls mostly offer parent makeup at a low cost or even for free.

4
00:00:21.816 --> 00:00:29.712
Weighing the cost for both sets of parents, couples already stretched by wedding expenses naturally find the convenient wedding hall package appealing.

5
00:00:30.048 --> 00:00:38.064
But it's usually handled by weekend-only part-timers rather than specialists, so the quality falls short of a dedicated shop.

6
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.088
Since makeup happens right at the wedding hall, it suits those who value convenience of logistics above all.

7
00:00:44.424 --> 00:00:50.280
Still, it may be hard to get individual requests met or a high-quality result.

8
00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:57.336
Choose a specialist shop if quality matters most, or the wedding hall package if convenience matters most.
